From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:56:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2877/3799] soh: rename func_80B3CA38 ->
 EnXc_KillUnlessMinuetPending

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: keeps this Sheik alive only for an adult who has not learned the Minuet
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index 96016bc49..0ab046111 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -289,7 +289,8 @@ void EnXc_SetupBlockPedestal(EnXc* this) {
     return;
 }
 
-void func_80B3CA38(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B3CA38: keeps this Sheik alive only for an adult who has not learned the Minuet
+void EnXc_KillUnlessMinuetPending(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     // If Player is adult but hasn't learned Minuet of Forest
     if (!Flags_GetEventChkInf(EVENTCHKINF_LEARNED_MINUET_OF_FOREST) && LINK_IS_ADULT) {
         this->action = SHEIK_ACTION_INIT;
@@ -2390,7 +2391,7 @@ void EnXc_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
             func_80B40590(this, play);
             break;
         case SHEIK_TYPE_MINUET:
-            func_80B3CA38(this, play);
+            EnXc_KillUnlessMinuetPending(this, play);  // was func_80B3CA38 [LLM:HIGH]
             break;
         case SHEIK_TYPE_BOLERO:
             func_80B3CB58(this, play);
